WEBVTT

00:11:59.026 --> 00:12:02.896
in the way the Foundation has even 
attracted educational partners.

00:12:02.896 --> 00:12:05.950
All of those are research universities, 
research partners.

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:07.990
The Foundation believes that research

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:11.520
is creating new ideas, 
creating new content

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:15.455
that are really going to do impact 
in changing the country's economy

00:12:15.455 --> 00:12:18.705
and really moving toward the future.

00:12:19.072 --> 00:12:22.750
To be able to do so, 
the Foundation understands carefully

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:26.060
that you need to build 
the research culture,

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:27.993
you need to have the funding mechanism

00:12:27.993 --> 00:12:31.718
for which the Foundation has created
the Qatar National Research Fund,